PRINTL 
PRINTFORML A self-proclaimed revolutionary. Due to her inherent contrarian nature, it's hard to say if she's actually serious or not.
PRINTFORML In the past, dissatisfied with the current state of affairs in Gensokyo, which was drowning in peace and quiet, she
PRINTFORML instigated a revolt and caused an incident after enticing Shinmyoumaru to turn the tables on the strong and elevate the weak.
PRINTFORML After her attempt to overthrow society failed, her antics drew the ire of most of Gensokyo's residents, who tried to
PRINTFORML exterminate her by any means necessary.
PRINTFORML However, after surviving the ordeal, she became something of an outlaw and tries to avoid the public like the plague.
PRINTFORML Nevertheless, her ambition still lives, as evidenced by her recent attempt to hijack the firework display with Shinmyoumaru.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML No one really knows the extent of her ability to turn over absolutely everything.
PRINTFORML Still, due to all the distance she puts between herself and others, it's rather difficult to see her true self.
PRINTFORML She finds enjoying simple pleasures unbearable, and interacting with people makes her depressed.
PRINTFORML That is, until her heart is conquered. Perhaps then, she will...

